[University of Stuttgart, Stuttgart, Germany, st173644@stud.uni-stuttgart.de; Michael Pradel, University of Stuttgart, Suttgart,](https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1623-498X)
Germany, michael@binaervarianz.de.


